# Map / details UX

- **My pin** FAB toggles `mapMode` `pin` ↔ `navigate`; tap map places pin; long-press pin to drag.
- Booth tap in navigate: popover (Navigate / View details). If details already open, also switch selection.
- Details **keep-open** pin is panel-level (`detailsPinned`), not per-vendor. Background tap closes only when unpinned.
- Booth layout edit is Settings → Customize → Map (draft rects; Save / Reset / Done).
- Tags: searchable `TagSelect` with “+ Add New”; map filter chips use `mergeTagCatalog`.
- Live party UI only when `isPartyLiveEnabled()` (prod same-origin, or `VITE_PARTY_WS_URL`). Capacitor builds need `VITE_PARTY_WS_URL=wss://con-floor-nav.onrender.com/party` at build time.
- Section labels use inverse-scale / screen-stable band — don’t break zoom math casually.
